WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.750
Pip and the Thunder.

00:00:02.083 --> 00:00:03.500
Pip was the smallest cloud

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.625
in the whole sky.

00:00:04.625 --> 00:00:05.958
And Pip was very, very

00:00:05.958 --> 00:00:06.958
scared of thunder.

00:00:10.458 --> 00:00:11.292
BOOM!

00:00:11.292 --> 00:00:12.125
Out of my way,

00:00:12.125 --> 00:00:13.125
little puff!

00:00:13.125 --> 00:00:14.417
This sky is MINE!

00:00:14.708 --> 00:00:15.667
Water, please...

00:00:15.667 --> 00:00:17.125
I'm so thirsty.

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:20.333
I'm scared...

00:00:20.333 --> 00:00:21.583
but Daisy needs me!

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:26.333
Thank you, Pip!

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:28.875
Being brave doesn't mean

00:00:28.875 --> 00:00:30.042
you're not scared.

00:00:30.042 --> 00:00:31.042
It means you help,

00:00:31.042 --> 00:00:32.167
even when you are.
